  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;As overall objective, the proposed Action aims towards improved life quality of youth in local communities through encouraging and increasing youth activism and volunteerism. In order to improve the current situation, predominantly in youth communities in the rural areas.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
